<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= post.title %> | Hearts of Birgunj</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/assets/logo.jpg">
    <style>
        .work-detail-container {
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem;
        }

        .work-detail-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 3.5rem;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .work-badge-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .work-featured-img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            max-height: 480px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
        }

        .work-meta-strip {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .work-meta-strip span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .work-meta-strip i {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .work-rich-content {
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: #334155;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
        }

        .work-rich-content h2 {
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 2rem 0 1.2rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.15);
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .work-rich-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .work-rich-content ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .work-rich-content ul li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .work-rich-content ul li::before {
            content: "\f058";
            font-family: "Font Awesome 6 Free";
            font-weight: 900;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 1px;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .work-rich-content strong {
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        /* Sidebar Styling */
        .work-sidebar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 100px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .sidebar-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
        }

        .sidebar-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
        }

        .sidebar-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .sidebar-links {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .sidebar-links a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .sidebar-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.06);
            color: var(--primary);
            border-color: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.2);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }

        .sidebar-links a.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .work-detail-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2.5rem;
            }
            .work-sidebar {
                position: static;
            }
            .work-rich-content {
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="back-btn-container">
        <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="btn btn-back">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> <span>Go Back</span>
        </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="navbar scrolled">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <img src="/assets/logo.jpg" alt="Hearts of Birgunj" class="logo-img">
                <span class="logo-text">हार्ट्स अफ वीरगन्ज<br><span style="font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:500;opacity:0.85">Hearts of Birgunj</span></span>
            </a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/about.html">About Us</a>
                <a href="/work.html" class="active">Our Work</a>
                <a href="/members.html">Our Members</a>
                <a href="/impact.html">Our Impact</a>
                <a href="/projects.html">Projects</a>
                <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <a href="/admin/login" class="btn btn-outline">Login</a>
                <a href="/donate.html" class="btn btn-primary">Support Us</a>
                <button class="mobile-menu-btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <span class="work-badge-pill" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); color: #ffffff;">
                    <i class="<%= post.icon || 'fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart' %>"></i> कार्यक्षेत्र — Hearts of Birgunj
                </span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="page-title"><%= post.title %></h1>
            <% if (post.subtitle) { %>
                <p><%= post.subtitle %></p>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Layout -->
    <main class="work-detail-container">
        <div class="work-detail-layout">
            <!-- Left: Main Work Content -->
            <div class="work-main">
                <div class="work-meta-strip">
                    <% if (post.location) { %>
                        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> <%= post.location %></span>
                    <% } %>
                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-building-ngo"></i> Hearts of Birgunj</span>
                    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: #16a34a;"></i> सक्रिय कार्यक्षेत्र</span>
                </div>

                <% if (post.image_url) { %>
                    <img src="/<%= post.image_url %>" alt="<%= post.title %>" class="work-featured-img">
                <% } %>

                <article class="work-rich-content">
                    <%- post.content %>

                    <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <a href="/work.html" class="btn btn-outline">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> हाम्रा सबै कार्यक्षेत्रहरू (All Work Areas)
                        </a>
                        <a href="/donate.html" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i> यस कार्यमा सहयोग गर्नुहोस् (Support Us)
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Sidebar -->
            <aside class="work-sidebar">
                <!-- Action Card -->
                <div class="sidebar-card" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); color: white;">
                    <span style="color: #fb7185; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Join Hands</span>
                    <h3 style="color: white; margin-top: 0.5rem;">यस अभियानमा जोडिनुहोस्</h3>
                    <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);">Hearts of Birgunj सँग जोडिएर वीरगञ्जमा सकारात्मक परिवर्तनको हिस्सा बन्नुहोस्।</p>
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem;">
                        <a href="/donate.html" class="btn btn-primary" style="justify-content: center;">सहयोग गर्नुहोस् (Donate)</a>
                        <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="justify-content: center; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); color: white;">सम्पर्क गर्नुहोस् (Contact Us)</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <% if (typeof otherWorks !== 'undefined' && otherWorks.length > 0) { %>
                <!-- Other Work Areas -->
                <div class="sidebar-card">
                    <h3>अन्य कार्यक्षेत्रहरू</h3>
                    <ul class="sidebar-links">
                        <% otherWorks.forEach(ow => { %>
                        <li>
                            <a href="/work/<%= ow.id %>" class="<%= ow.id === post.id ? 'active' : '' %>">
                                <span><i class="<%= ow.icon || 'fa-solid fa-angle-right' %>" style="margin-right: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem;"></i> <%= ow.title %></span>
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right" style="font-size: 0.75rem;"></i>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                        <% }) %>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <% } %>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer" id="contact-footer">
        <div class="container footer-grid">
            <div class="footer-about">
                <a href="/" class="logo footer-logo">
                    <img src="/assets/logo.jpg" alt="Hearts of Birgunj" class="logo-img">
                </a>
                <p>Hearts of Birgunj is dedicated to inspiring change, transforming lives, and fostering resilient
                    communities through active youth participation.</p>
                <div class="social-links">
                    <a href="https://facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                    <a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="mailto:heartsofbirgunj@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i></a>
                    <a href="https://youtube.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-links">
                <h3>Our Work</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="/work.html">सामाजिक सेवा तथा मानव सहयोग</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/work.html">स्वास्थ्य तथा सरसफाइ</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/work.html">शिक्षा तथा युवा विकास</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/work.html">वातावरण संरक्षण</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-links">
                <h3>Quick Links</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="/about.html">About Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/about.html#history">Our History</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/projects.html">Impact Stories</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/donate.html">Support Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/contact.html">Contact Us</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-contact">
                <h3>Contact</h3>
                <p><i class="fa-solid fa-map-pin"></i> Birgunj Mahanagarpalika, Parsa, Nepal</p>
                <p><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> +977-9763368173</p>
                <p><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> heartsofbirgunj@gmail.com</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <div class="container">
                <p>&copy; 2025 Hearts of Birgunj. All Rights Reserved. Serving Humanity, Inspiring Hope.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="/script.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
